It contains the working website, the 3D closet builder, the parts catalogue
and the pricing logic of a real cabinetry business, together with
photographs of jobs that business measured, built and installed. It is
public only because GitHub Pages serves a free site from a public
repository. Public visibility is a hosting requirement, not a licence.

